IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc-definitions`
IMPORT `roc1-order-3-time`
IMPORT `roc1-order-6`
IMPORT `roc1-order-4`

-- TESTS for roc1-order-4.l4 (Order 4, parties and causes of action).  Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion.

`o 4 test aged 17` MEANS `Natural person` OF 17
`o 4 test aged 18` MEANS `Natural person` OF 18
`o 4 test aged 19` MEANS `Natural person` OF 19
`o 4 test aged 20` MEANS `Natural person` OF 20
`o 4 test aged 21` MEANS `Natural person` OF 21
`o 4 test aged 40` MEANS `Natural person` OF 40
`o 4 test entity` MEANS Entity OF TRUE

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      minutes IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Moment
`o 4 test moment at` MEANS Moment WITH
    `day of the moment` IS day
    `minutes after midnight` IS minutes

-- Rule 1: limbs (a), (b), (c) and the gathered list
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(a) a person aged 18 or older but below 21 may be a party in their own name` `o 4 test aged 19` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(a) a person aged 18 or older but below 21 may be a party in their own name` `o 4 test aged 19` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(a) a person aged 18 or older but below 21 may be a party in their own name` `o 4 test aged 18` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
