#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(b) a person aged 21 or older may be a party in their own name` `o 4 test entity` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(c) an entity with the capacity to sue or be sued may be a party in its own name` `o 4 test entity` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(c) an entity with the capacity to sue or be sued may be a party in its own name` `o 4 test entity` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 4 r 1(c) an entity with the capacity to sue or be sued may be a party in its own name` `o 4 test aged 40` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
